# Battle Map feed refresh, for machines without systemd user timers. Add with: crontab -e
# cron has a minimal PATH, so everything is an absolute path: find yours with `command -v battlemap-sync gh`.
# Add `--host ghe.example.com` for GitHub Enterprise. The server itself still needs to run (see deploy/install-systemd.sh
# for a unit, or start it in tmux: battlemap --repo ~/code/repo --prs ~/.local/share/battlemap/prs.json --rescan 600).
*/2 * * * * /usr/local/bin/battlemap-sync github --repo org/repo --gh /usr/bin/gh --out "$HOME/.local/share/battlemap/prs.json" --quiet
